    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG is delighted to present No. 1 Stepaside Villas to the market, a bright and superbly presented family home enjoying a prime position in the heart of Stepaside Village. This attractive home offers the perfect balance of village living and urban convenience, with an excellent selection of local shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational amenities all within easy walking distance. The property is exceptionally well connected, benefiting from excellent public transport links, including nearby bus routes and the Luas at Glencairn, providing swift access to Dublin City Centre and beyond. An ideal choice for families and professionals alike, this sought-after address combines a strong sense of community with outstanding convenience.\n\nExtending to approximately 106 sq.m (1,141 sq.ft), the well-appointed accommodation comprises a welcoming living room with double doors leading to the kitchen which overlooks the low-maintenance rear garden. The main house features four generously proportioned double bedrooms and a family bathroom. A notable feature of the property is the self-contained living space, comprising a kitchen/breakfast room, bedroom and bathroom, offering excellent flexibility for extended family, guest accommodation or home office use. Subject to the necessary consents and due diligence, this space can be readily reintegrated into the main residence.\n\nThe property further benefits from off-street parking to the front and convenient side access to the rear garden.\nRecreational amenities are in abundance within the locality including Fernhill Park and Gardens, various playgrounds, interesting walking trails in the nearby Dublin Mountains, numerous golf courses, rugby, football and tennis clubs to name a few. Sandyford Village, Dundrum Town Centre, Carrickmines Retail Park, Beacon South Quarter, Leopardstown Shopping Centre and Racecourse are also within easy reach. \n \nA selection of local schools include Stepaside Educate Together, Gaelscoil Thaobh na Coille, St. Mary's and Rosemont School are within a short walk and Our Lady of The Wayside, Holy Trinity and Kilternan Church of Ireland a few minutes' drive away.\n\nConnectivity is a key feature of this location, with regular Dublin Bus services (including the 44 and 47 routes) and the nearby Luas Green Line at Glencairn providing excellent public transport options. The M50 and N11 road networks are also easily accessible, ensuring convenient travel throughout Dublin and beyond.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all this wonderful family home has to offer."
      },
